                  "description": {
                    "value": "You unleash a mighty wave from your hand that buffets back your foes. Each creature in the area must attempt a Fortitude saving throw. If a creature pushed by unbreaking wave advance would be pushed into a solid barrier or another creature, it stops at that point and takes 3d6 damage.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is pushed 10 feet.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is pushed 20 feet."
                  },
                  "higher_level_description": {
                    "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage for pushing a creature into a solid barrier increases by 1d6."
